	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Convert whatever markdown is on the clipboard into rendered rich text,
in place, so pasting into Teams, Word, Mail, Notes, Slack desktop, etc. shows
real bold, lists and headings instead of raw markdown syntax.

Usage
  1. Copy some markdown to the clipboard, from anywhere.
  2. Trigger Alfred and type: copyrmd
  3. Paste. A notification confirms the byte count, or reports an error.

Requires pandoc (brew install pandoc). macOS only.</string>
